<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In PalmX 2025: The First Shared Task on Benchmarking LLMs on Arabic and Islamic Culture" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">6</span> </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
