<td id="A2.T7.2.19.3" class="ltx_td"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.20" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;">
<td id="A2.T7.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;">Sirah (Biography of the Prophet)</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">؟يبنلا</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">ضرم</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">دتشا</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">نأ</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">دعب</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">سانلاب</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">ىلص</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">يذلا</span> <span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text">نم</span><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.1.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span id="A2.T7.2.20.2.2" class="ltx_text"></span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.20.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right"><span id="A2.T7.2.20.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;">2.0</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.21.1" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.T7.2.21.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F9F9F9;">Who led the people in prayer after the Prophet’s illness became severe?</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.21.3" class="ltx_td"></td></tr>
